/DSCN1174.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n Guest Book: It&#039;s white and clothy with a bow: \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i105.photobucket.com\/albums\/m211\/dmarie17\/DSCN1175.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n Favor Tags: These aren&#039;t place cards. I used them in my thank you cards to tell people the link to our pics. \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i105.photobucket.com\/albums\/m211\/dmarie17\/DSCN1176.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":464365,"PostDate":1222550662,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Please take this stuff!! I need room to put all of our wedding gifts! I would love it if one person wanted everything but i'll separate if necessary. All of it is brand new... in orignal packaging except the flutes are just out. I never used them, but thought that I was going to so I tossed the box. <br \/> Just pay shipping please!! <br \/> <br \/> Flutes: they have little dots on them... kinda weird but cute enough. <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i105.photobucket.com\/albums\/m211\/dmarie17\/DSCN1169.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> More flutes: these are plastic (i think) and colored. There are 6 in the set. I guess they're for the guests. <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i105.photobucket.com